section(data-part="Playing-in")
    h1 Does a violin's sound identity change as it is played?

    aside.notes.
        Let us see whether the sound identity of a violin can change as it is played.

section
    p.quote "A violin's sound improves through regular playing..."
    p.fragment.opens It "#[span opens up]"

    //- The quote steps back while "opens up" opens up: from squeezed and blurred to spread and sharp
    style.
        @scope {
            .quote {
                transition: opacity 1s ease;
            }

            :scope:has(.opens.visible) .quote {
                opacity: 0.2;
            }

            .opens {
                font-family: var(--r-heading-font);
                font-size: var(--r-heading2-size);
