section
    aside(data-markdown).notes.
        For each series, we made several kinds of measurements:
        1. We measured the bridge admittance (the frequency response) of each violin
        2. We recorded excerpts played by every violinist on every violin
        3. We asked every violinist to rate each instrument on several criteria
        4. We recorded the bowing movements of the Test Violinist on each instrument

        After the experiment, we also ran a listening test on the recordings we collected. Not to give too much information at once, I will present this test together with its results.
    
